  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p>About our brand and products:  </p><p>LifeWeb Mycology is a premium functional mushroom brand focused on quality, daily ritual, and connection with nature. Our formulas use fruiting body mushroom extracts including Lion’s Mane, Reishi, Cordyceps, Turkey Tail, and Chaga. We create powerful mushroom powders and mushroom-infused coffee designed to support focus, balance, and everyday wellness.</p><p><br></p><p>What makes us different:  </p><p>We focus on high-quality extracts, clean formulations, and a strong brand philosophy centered around nature, ritual, and performance. LifeWeb Mycology products are designed to integrate easily into daily routines like morning coffee or wellness rituals.</p><p><br></p><p>How affiliates can earn:  </p><p>Affiliates earn 10% commission on every sale generated through their unique affiliate link or discount code. Affiliates can also offer their audience 15% off using their custom code.</p><p><br></p><p>How to promote us:  </p><p>Affiliates typically promote LifeWeb Mycology through social media content, educational posts about functional mushrooms, wellness routines, productivity tips, coffee rituals, and biohacking or natural health content.</p><p><br></p><p>Other information:  </p><p>We welcome creators, influencers, educators, and wellness advocates who are passionate about natural health and functional mushrooms.</p></div></div>",
